  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialText_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a92d78ffa075bab41a641bcab300661e, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 11093512192
    m_Localized: Greetings, Roller of Dice. I am DEE YEM, and I will be your guide
      in this arena.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 240794570752
    m_Localized: Harness the W, A, S and D keys to move about the area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 347543801856
    m_Localized: A true warrior knows when to make a daring approach as well as a
      tactical retreat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 452195880960
    m_Localized: Look alive! These foes mean you harm. Invoke the SPACE key to use
      LIGHT ATTACKS and dispatch them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 587197943808
    m_Localized: More adversaries allot more glory! Hold the SPACE key to channel
      your power into a HEAVY ATTACK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 824327114752
    m_Localized: 'Roller of Dice, hear this: if you knock a foe into a wall with
      a HEAVY ATTACK or otherwise they will be SLAMMED against it and experience
      pain unmatched!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1351261720576
    m_Localized: Once a battle has concluded, you must claim a new SPELL or restore
      your VItality. Choose wisely! This decision could determine your fate in the
      next bout...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1405875752960
    m_Localized: This tablet is a tool to manage your MAGIC.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1527841918976
    m_Localized: Here you can assign new SPELLS to your die faces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1729004933120
    m_Localized: Store magic in your INVENTORY for later use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2017313001472
    m_Localized: Wield your MOUSE to move this new SPELL into one of your SPELL SLOTS,
      and it will be harnessed by one of your die faces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2346574254080
    m_Localized: Now, take the spell in your inventory and COMBINE it with your new
      spell. This will enhance the power of the spell and unveil new effects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2523737460736
    m_Localized: You learn well! But take heed, as you can only combine spells of
      the SAME TYPE and LEVEL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2822489346048
    m_Localized: Roller of Dice, you should now be prepared to take on the arena.
      I will remain to explain the effects of any spells you acquire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4818030137344
    m_Localized: In this instance, I demand you this SPELL, thus I can teach you
      about MAGIC!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5755012485120
    m_Localized: Listen close Roller, defeat this adversaries with HEAVY ATTACKS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
